услуги</strong></p>\n			</td>\n			<td nowrap="nowrap" style="width:43px;height:20px;">\n			<p align="right"><strong>40 м2</strong></p>\n			</td>\n			<td nowrap="nowrap" style="width:43px;height:20px;">\n			<p align="right"><strong>50 м2</strong></p>\n			</td>\n			<td nowrap="nowrap" style="width:43px;height:20px;">\n			<p align="right"><strong>60 м2</strong></p>\n			</td>\n			<td nowrap="nowrap" style="width:43px;height:20px;">\n			<p align="right"><strong>70 м2</strong></p>\n			</td>\n			<td nowrap="nowrap" style="width:43px;height:20px;">\n			<p align="right"><strong>80 м2</strong></p>\n			</td>\n			<td nowrap="nowrap" style="width:53px;height:20px;">\n			<p align="right"><strong>90 м2</strong></p>\n			</td>\n			<td nowrap="nowrap" style="width:53px;height:20px;">\n			<p align="right"><strong>100 м2</strong></p>\n			</td>\n			<td nowrap="nowrap" style="width:160px;height:20px;">\n			<p><strong>свыше 100 м2</strong></p>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td nowrap="nowrap" style="width:193px;height:40px;">\n			<p><em>поддерживающая уборка</em></p>\n			</td>\n			<td nowrap="nowrap" style="width:43px;height:40px;">\n			<p align="right"><em></em></p>\n			</td>\n			<td nowrap="nowrap" style="width:43px;height:40px;">\n			<p align="right"><em>1900 руб.</em></p>\n			</td>\n			<td nowrap="nowrap" style="width:43px;height:40px;">\n			<p align="right"><em></em></p>\n			</td>\n			<td nowrap="nowrap" style="width:43px;height:40px;">\n			<p align="right"><em>2400 руб.</em></p>\n			</td>\n			<td nowrap="nowrap" style="width:43px;height:40px;">\n			<p align="right"><em></em></p>\n			</td>\n			<td nowrap="nowrap" style="width:53px;height:40px;">\n			<p align="right"><em>2900 руб.</em></p>\n			</td>\n			<td nowrap="nowrap" style="width:53px;height:40px;">\n			<p align="right"><em></em></p>\n			</td>\n			<td style="width:160px;height:40px;">\n			<p><em>3400 + 25 рублей за 1 м2</em></p>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td nowrap="nowrap" style="width:193px;height:40px;">\n			<p><em>гене