 OR LOSSES SUSTAINED BY\r\nYOU OR THIRD PARTIES OR A FAILURE OF THE PROGRAM TO OPERATE WITH ANY OTHER\r\nPROGRAMS), EVEN IF SUCH HOLDER OR OTHER PARTY HAS BEEN ADVISED OF THE\r\nPOSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGES.\r\n\r\n---------------------------\r\nEND OF TERMS AND CONDITIONS";s:6:"readme";s:290:"--------------------\r\nPackage: fcmspayment\r\n--------------------\r\nVersion: 0.4.2-a1\r\nReleased: May, 25, 2015\r\nAuthors: Egor Bolgov <egor.b@fabricasaitov.ru>, George Bespyatykh <georgy.b@fabricasaitov.ru>\r\n\r\nThis package performs support of different payment gates for Shopkeeper package\r\n\r\n";s:9:"changelog";s:1681:"Changelog for fcmspayment.\r\n    \r\nfcmspayment 0.4.2-a1 (25 May 2015)\r\n====================================\r\n- Fix code for new shopkeper v3\r\n\r\nfcmspayment 0.4.1-a1 (21 January 2014)\r\n====================================\r\n- Add checking payment status by cron\r\n- Reduced settings saving time\r\n- Bugfixes\r\n\r\nfcmspayment 0.4.0-a1 (05 December 2013)\r\n====================================\r\n- Add RBK Money payment system\r\n\r\nfcmspayment 0.3.3-b1 (23 October 2013)\r\n====================================\r\n- Add invoice print function\r\n\r\nfcmspayment 0.3.2-b1 (09 September 2013)\r\n====================================\r\n- Add qiwi payment system\r\n\r\nfcmspayment 0.3.1-a1 (08 August 2013)\r\n====================================\r\n- Add robokassa payment check request\r\n\r\nfcmspayment 0.3.0-a1 (17 July 2013)\r\n====================================\r\n- Add list of payment records\r\n\r\nfcmspayment 0.2.0-b1 (12 July 2013)\r\n====================================\r\n- Add snippet fcmspaymentCreate that allows create of payments without shopkeeper\r\n- Add support of "cash" paymethod in fcmspaymentForm\r\n\r\nfcmspayment 0.1.2-b1 (25 June 2013)\r\n====================================\r\n- Fix installation bug with no autoincrement on tables\r\n- Fix bug with wrong enum values\r\n- Add default config fields for titles\r\n\r\nfcmspayment 0.1.0-b2 (24 June 2013)\r\n====================================\r\n- Fix installation without assets and connectors\r\n- Package for modx-2.2.8-pl\r\n\r\nfcmspayment 0.1.0-b1 (10 June 2013)\r\n====================================\r\n- Basic functions ready\r\n- Robokassa half support ready\r\n\r\nfcmspayment 0.0.1-a1 (30 May 2013)\r\n====================================\r\n- Initial release with DB schema";}', 'fcmspayment', '', 0, 4, 2, 'a', 1);
